ficances, results, justifications, findings, and impacts of research.\", \"CO5: Compare and contrast the research findings and outcomes with confidence.\", \"CO6: Produce an academic writing.\"], \"presentation\": [{\"item\": \"Overall Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Presentation lack of structure, background not properly introduced, and proposed solution does not seem to be linked.\", \"Presentation organization seems adequate although linkage between background of project with proposed solution is unclear.\", \"Clear organizational pattern. Smooth presentation where background of project is explained together with acceptable solution.\", \"Professionally-structured. Very smooth presentation where background of project is explained clearly before going into very innovative solution.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Communication Skill\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Poor body language, gestures, pace/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation.\", \"Good body language and gestures but poor on pace/speed, slide arrangement, pitch/enunciation.\", \"Good body language, gestures, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation but not at correct pace/speed.\", \"Excellent body language, gestures, pace/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Objectives, Problem Statement and Scope Presentment\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Does not give relevance objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to give limited information on objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Analysis Skill\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Does not give sufficient information that relates to the research topic or without proper citation.\", \"Able to give limited information on statement related to research topic using sentences directly from the sources.\", \"Able to state the problem but somewhat unable to relate the problem to research topic using own words.\", \"Able to relate problem statement to project using extensive information from various sources using own sentences in presentation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Impact Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Student cannot deliver the impact of the developed project with supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to sufficiently deliver impacts of the developed project with minimal supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to deliver impacts of the developed project with few supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to excellently deliver impacts of the developed project with supports and evidence.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Result Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Student presented the result poorly.\", \"Student presented the result with hesitation and not confident.\", \"Student was able to present the result well.\", \"Student was able to present the result confidently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Q&A Justification\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Able to partially answer and defend project findings but unable to project background and scope.\", \"Able to answer and defend project findings and have difficulty to relate with project background and scope.\", \"Confidence in answering and defending project finding based on the understanding to project background and scope.\", \"Clearly and precisely answers and defends project findings based on understanding to project 