igher marks if launched on platforms.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Limitation & Future Work\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Limitation & future works are poorly identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation & future works are sufficiently identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation and possible future works in developed project are identified.\", \"Limitation and significant future works in developed project are excellently acknowledged and identified.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"End Product Demo Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Final outcome of FYP2 cannot be clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has a slight vagueness when delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been delivered/presented well to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"brochure\": [{\"item\": \"Organization & Structure\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Very disorganized, confusing flow of information.\", \"Organization is weak, difficult to follow in places.\", \"Mostly organized, but some sections could be better structured.\", \"Information is logically organized, flows smoothly.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Professionalism\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not achieve professional and shows no effort in drafting; poor use of visuals; unappealing.\", \"Brochure moderately achieve professional standards and shows few efforts in drafting; limited use of visuals; basic design.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards well and shows efforts in drafting; good use of visuals, though lacking creativity or consistency.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards and excellently drafted; excellent use of colours 