ls for project implementation, etc.\", \"Excellent amount of efforts is demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 2 Skills in Evaluating Obtained Results\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to determine systematic evaluation method to obtain result.\", \"Student was able to somewhat determine evaluation method, with guidance and suggestion.\", \"Student was able to determine appropriate evaluation method, but lacking systematic procedure or lacking in some area.\", \"Student was able to choose excellent and systematic evaluation method to obtain results.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Identifying Project Significance, Findings, Impacts and Justification\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Student cannot discuss, justify and identify significance of the project outcome, impact, and need maximum guidance.\", \"Student was able to adequately discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome with guidance.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome well with minimal supervision.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Analysing Results Obtained\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to interpret results obtained and can barely discuss it with SV.\", \"Student was able to explain obtained result to SV with limited discussion.\", \"Student was able to adequately explain the obtained result to SV, but more are needed.\", \"Student was able to thoroughly and logically explain the obtained result to SV and directly related to the review of literature.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"