ure and suitable analysis method.\", \"Able to explain experimental design procedure but unable to justify the selection of suitable analysis method.\", \"Able to elaborate design and experimental procedure but does not clearly justify the selection of analysis method.\", \"Able to elaborate design and procedures of experiment and justify the selection of suitable analysis method.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Q & A\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Able to partially answer and defend project findings but unable to project background and scope.\", \"Able to answer and defend project findings and have difficulty to relate with project background and scope.\", \"Confidence in answering and defending project finding based on the understanding to project background and scope.\", \"Clearly and precisely answers and defends project findings based on understanding to project background and scope.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Project Schedule\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Gives a Gantt chart with limited details.\", \"Gives a Gantt chart with limited information regarding work breakdown structure and visualizes tasks on a timeline.\", \"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with sufficient scope of work, and visualizes specific tasks on a timeline.\", \"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with the scope of work, and visualizes all tasks on a timeline, showing their start and finish dates, dependencies between them and other information.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}], \"project_outcome\": [{\"item\": \"Innovative Value\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"Proposed project exists abundantly or did not relate to the introduced problem.\", \"Proposed project is not new, and quite beneficial to the introduced problem.\", \"Proposed project is not new but beneficial and less applied to the introduced problem.\", \"Proposed project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and applicable to the introduced problem.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Tech Stack/Tools Application\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"Tech stack/tools chosen are not justified/suitable.\", \"Tech stack/tools chosen are adequately justified/suitable.\", \"Tech stack/tools chosen are justified/suitable.\", \"Tech stack/tools chosen are excellently justified/suitable.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Preliminary Implementation\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"No preliminary UI/experiments have been conducted.\", \"Poor preliminary UI/experiments have been designed/conducted.\", \"Sufficient preliminary UI/experiments have been partially designed/conducted.\", \"UI/experiments have been partially designed/conducted. Some preliminary results have been obtained\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Time Management\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' poor management of time in conducting it.\", \"End product in FYP1 shows students\' sufficient management of time in conducting it.\", \"End product in FYP1 shows students\' good management of time in conducting it.\", \"End product in FYP1 shows students\' excellent management of time in conducting it.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"End Product Demo/Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 2.5, \"levels\": [\"No final outcome of FYP1 that has a solid existence to be delivered/presented, only theory/process idea.\", \"Final outcome of FYP1 has a slight existence to be delivered/presented.\", \"Final outcome of FYP1 has little existence to be delivered/presented.\", \"Final outcome of FYP1 has a solid existence/prototype to be delivered/presented.\"], \"comments\": \"\", \"s\": 0, \"m\": 0}], \"justification\": \"\", \"general_comments\": \"\", \"sv_evaluation\": [{\"ite