; unappealing.\", \"Brochure moderately achieve professional standards and shows few efforts in drafting; limited use of visuals; basic design.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards well and shows efforts in drafting; good use of visuals, though lacking creativity or consistency.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards and excellently drafted; excellent use of colours and visuals that enhance readability.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Methodology Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure contains very minimal or no method/process/workflow explanation.\", \"Brochure covers method/process/workflow superficially; limited explanation.\", \"Brochure covers most method/process/workflow but lacks depth in one area.\", \"Brochure clearly explains method/process/workflow at an appropriate level for the audience.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Tech Stack Choice\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not indicate tech stack/accurate tech stack.\", \"Brochure indicates tech stack but inaccurate or in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack in a sufficient way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack, with clear explanation of each tool\'s usage.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Results/Findings Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not highlight results/findings.\", \"Brochure included results/findings in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure included results/findings, sometimes unclear, with room for improvement or missing parts.\", \"Brochure highlighted results/findings clearly, concisely, and shows understanding of the outcome\'s significance.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"sv_evaluation\": [{\"item\": \"Progress 1 Skills in Sourcing Technical Solution/Implementation\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 5, \"levels\": [\"No efforts are demonstrated in sourcing for mat