\"Final product shows good implementation work.\", \"Final product shows excellent implementation work.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Choices of method, tools and requirement\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Student did not choose proper method, tools or select proper requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to choose sufficient method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to choose appropriate method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to excellently choose proper method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Functionalities\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Apps/research have been implemented but with many errors.\", \"Apps/research have been implemented but several functions are lacking.\", \"Apps/research have been implemented and functioning. Still need fine tuning before ready to be used.\", \"Apps/research have been conducted completely and fully functioning. No improvements on function needed. Higher marks if launched on platforms.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Limitation & Future Work\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Limitation & future works are poorly identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation & future works are sufficiently identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation and possible future works in developed project are identified.\", \"Limitation and significant future works in developed project are excellently acknowledged and identified.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"End Product Demo Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Final outcome of FYP2 cannot be clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has a slight vagueness when delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been delivered/presented well to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"brochure\": [{\"item\": \"Organization & Structure\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Very disorganized, confusing flow of information.\", \"Organization is weak, difficult to follow in places.\", \"Mostly organized, but some sections could be better structured.\", \"Information is logically organized, flows smoothly.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Professionalism\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not achieve professional and shows no effort in drafting; poor use of visuals; unappealing.\", \"Brochure moderately achieve professional standards and shows few efforts in drafting; limited use of visuals; basic design.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards well and shows efforts in drafting; good use of visuals, though lacking creativity or consistency.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards and excellently drafted; excellent use of colours and visuals that enhance readability.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Methodology Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure contains very minimal or no method/process/workflow explanation.\", \"Brochure covers method/process/workflow superficially; limited explanation.\", \"Brochure covers most method/process/workflow but lacks depth in one area.\", \"Brochure clearly explains method/process/workflow at an appropriate level for the audience.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Tech Stack Choice\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not indicate tech stack/accurate tech stack.\", \"Brochure indicates tech stack but inaccurate or in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack in a sufficient way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack, with clear explanation of each tool\'s usage.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Results/Findings Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not highlight results/findings.\", \"Brochure included results/findings in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure included results/findings, sometimes unclear, with room for improvement or missing parts.\", \"Brochure highlighted results/findings clearly, concisely, and shows understanding of the outcome\'s significance.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"sv_evaluation\": [{\"item\": \"Progress 1 Skills in Sourcing Technical Solution/Implementation\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 5, \"levels\": [\"No efforts are demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\", \"Somewhat sufficient amount of efforts is demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, etc, but still lacking self-exploration.\", \"Sufficient amount of efforts demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\", \"Excellent amount of efforts is demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 2 Skills in Evaluating Obtained Results\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to determine systematic evaluation method to obtain result.\", \"Student was able to somewhat determine evaluation method, with guidance and suggestion.\", \"Student was able to determine appropriate evaluation method, but lacking systematic procedure or lacking in some area.\", \"Student was able to choose excellent and systematic evaluation method to obtain results.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Identifying Project Significance, Findings, Impacts and Justification\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Student cannot discuss, justify and identify significance of the project outcome, impact, and need maximum guidance.\", \"Student was able to adequately discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome with guidance.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome well with minimal supervision.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Analysing Results Obtained\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to interpret results obtained and can barely discuss it with SV.\", \"Student was able to explain obtained result to SV with limited discussion.\", \"Student was able to adequately explain the obtained result to SV, but more are needed.\", \"Student was able to thoroughly and logically explain the obtained result to SV and directly related to the review of literature.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 4 Final Thesis Preparation\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Final thesis submission was last minute for supervisor revision with major mistakes (formatting, organization, major correction).\", \"Final thesis submission was adequately proper for supervisor to revise with several mistakes in preparation.\", \"Final thesis submission was proper for supervisor to revise with good preparation.\", \"Final thesis submission was at proper time for supervisor revision with very good preparation (format, organization, very little correction).\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Overall Initiative & Independence\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Passive; waits for supervisor to dictate every action.\", \"Limited initiative; depends heavily on supervisor for next steps.\", \"Demonstrates initiative with occasional reliance on supervisor’s direction.\", \"Highly self-motivated; takes initiative in exploring solutions; shows ownership of project.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Approach to Planning\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Little to no effort. Poor attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\", \"Adequate effort. Several lacking in attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\", \"Less organised, good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation, but sometimes require reminders.\", \"Highly organised and on track. Very good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}], \"report\": [{\"item\": \"Thesis Organization\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Thesis organization is not arranged logically with major errors.\", \"Thesis organization is somewhat arranged logically with weak links and several errors.\", \"Thesis organization is arranged logically and clearly linked with minimal error.\", \"Thesis organization is logical with strong link between units.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Formatting\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Margins, spacing, page numbering, typeface, Title page, Table of Contents, references and headings failed to comply with format.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, and page numbering comply with format. There are minor mistakes with headings, references, Title page, and/or Table of Contents.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, page numbering, references, and headings followed the required format. There are minor mistakes with Table of Contents.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, page numbering, headings, references and Table of Contents followed the required format.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Workflow Details\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project poorly.\", \"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project sufficiently.\", \"Thesis presented well the whole process of executing the project.\", \"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Gantt Chart\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Project activities and milestones are not described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are partially described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are generally described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are clearly described.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Abstract\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"The abstract does not tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are adequately clear and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are clear and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are clear, concise and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Literature\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Literature consisted of a string of summaries of the various studies with no attempt to integrate similar studies.\", \"Some attempt is made to integrate similar studies and to compare and contrast findings.\", \"Similar studies are integrated and findings are somewhat compared and contrasted.\", \"The literature review is comprehensive and connected to the current study.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Results Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Results of research/implementation is written poorly.\", \"Results of research/implementation is written sufficiently.\", \"Results of research/imple