understanding to project background and scope.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Project Schedule\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":2,\"levels\":[\"Gives a Gantt chart with limited details.\",\"Gives a Gantt chart with limited information regarding work breakdown structure and visualizes tasks on a timeline.\",\"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with sufficient scope of work, and visualizes specific tasks on a timeline.\",\"Gives and describes Gantt chart regarding work breakdown structure with the scope of work, and visualizes all tasks on a timeline, showing their start and finish dates, dependencies between them and other information.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"project_outcome\":[{\"item\":\"Innovative Value\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Proposed project exists abundantly or did not relate to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is not new, and quite beneficial to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is not new but beneficial and less applied to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and applicable to the introduced problem.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Tech Stack\\/Tools Application\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are not justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are adequately justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are excellently justified\\/suitable.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Preliminary Implementation\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"No preliminary UI\\/experiments have been conducted.\",\"Poor preliminary UI\\/experiments have been designed\\/conducted.\",\"Sufficient preliminary UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted.\",\"UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted. Some preliminary results have been obtained\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Time Management\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' poor management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' sufficient management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' good management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' excellent management of time in conducting it.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"End Product Demo\\/Delivery\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":2.5,\"levels\":[\"No final outcome of FYP1 that has a solid existence to be delivered\\/presented, only theory\\/process idea.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a slight existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has little existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a solid existence\\/prototype to be delivered\\/presented.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"justification\":\"\",\"general_comments\":\"\",\"sv_evaluation\":[{\"item\":\"Progress 1 Skills in Identifying Problem Statement, Objectives, Scope\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student put no own effort and work in defining the proposed project and finalise it only with supervision.\",\"Student put less own effort and work in defining the proposed project and need supervision.\",\"Student put adequate own effort and work in defining the proposed project with supervision.\",\"Student put maximal own effort and work in defining the proposed project with minimal supervision.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 2 Skills in Reviewing Literature\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student cannot conduct adequate review and took very long time.\",\"Student conducted adequate review with maximum guidance on the process.\",\"Student conducted review with guidance and came out with good review.\",\"Student conducted review with minimum guidance and came out with comprehensive review.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 3 Skills in exploring methods and tools\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Student did not implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can sufficiently implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can nicely implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\",\"Student can excellently implement a thorough and systematic project implementation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Progress 4 Final Thesis Preparation\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Final thesis submission was last minute for supervisor revision with major mistakes (formatting, organization, major correction).\",\"Final thesis submission was adequately proper for supervisor to revise with several mistakes in preparation.\",\"Final thesis submission was proper for supervisor to revise with good preparation.\",\"Final thesis submission was at proper time for supervisor revision with very good preparation (format, organization, very little correction).\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Overall Initiative & Independence\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Passive; waits for supervisor to dictate every action.\",\"Limited initiative; depends heavily on supervisor for next steps.\",\"Demonstrates initiative with occasional reliance on supervisor\\u2019s direction.\",\"Highly self-motivated; takes initiative in exploring solutions; shows ownership of project.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0},{\"item\":\"Overall Approach to Planning\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":4,\"levels\":[\"Little to no effort. Poor attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\",\"Adequate effort. Several lacking in attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\",\"Less organised, good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation, but sometimes require reminders.\",\"Highly organised and on track. Very good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0}],\"report\":[{\"item\":\"Content Organization\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Content is not arranged logically.\",\"Content is somewhat arranged logically with weak links.\",\"Content is arranged logically and they are usually clearly linked.\",\"Content is organized logically with strong link between units.\"],\"comments\":\"AS\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Formatting\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Formatting has major mistake.\",\"Formatting has minor mistake.\",\"Formatting has minimal mistake.\",\"No formatting mistake.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Background, Objectives, & Scope\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"Does not give relevance objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to give limited information on objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\",\"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Literature Review\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Poor review on background, tools, methodology or similar works.\",\"Adequate review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\",\"Very comprehensive review on background, tools, methodology and similar works.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Citations\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Citations are insufficient or incorrectly used within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Some citing mistakes are made within body of the thesis and reference list.\",\"Citations are clearly identified, however, there may have been minor errors, conventions and format are used.\",\"All reference materials are clearly identified and correctly cited in both the body of the text and the reference section.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Chosen Methodology\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Selection of methodology is not suitable and proves very little knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is not very suitable and proves adequate knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is sufficient and proves good knowledge in implementing the project.\",\"Selection of methodology is very suitable and proves excellent knowledge in implementing the project.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Implementation\\/Design Details\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were not supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were partly supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\",\"Methodology of the implementation\\/design\\/experiments were strongly supported with suitable detail\\/diagrams\\/medium.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"Gantt Chart\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Project activities and milestones are not described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are partially described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are generally described.\",\"Project activities and milestones are clearly described.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0},{\"item\":\"References\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"Reference list has incorrect references order, incomplete reference information, incorrect identification of sources, and various mistakes.\",\"Reference list has incorrect references order, incomplete reference information, incorrect identification of sources, and various mistakes.\",\"Reference list has correct reference order, complete reference information, and only minor mistakes such as a misplaced period.\",\"All cited sources on the reference list has no mistakes and can be found.\"],\"comments\":\"\",\"s\":0,\"m\":0}],\"totals\":{\"presentation_S\":\"0.00\",\"presentation_M\":\"0.00\",\"presentation_total\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_S\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_M\":\"0.00\",\"project_outcome_total\":\"0.00\",\"sv_evaluation_S\":\"0.00\",\"sv_evaluation_total\":\"0.00\",\"report_S\":\"0.00\",\"report_M\":\"0.00\",\"report_total\":\"0.00\",\"grand_total\":\"0.00\"},\"id\":\"tpl_fyp1_marking_v7\"}','coordinator_admin','2026-05-06 07:21:19','2026-10-02 07:46:42',14,1,1),('tpl_fyp2_marking_v7','CSS3724 Final Year Project II Marking Rubric (BCS) Ver. 7','{\"title\": \"CSS3724 Final Year Project II Marking Rubric (BCS) Ver. 7\", \"course\": \"CSS3724 Final Year Project II\", \"fyp_stage\": \"FYP2\", \"student\": {\"name\": \"\", \"id\": \"\", \"supervisor\": \"\", \"examiner\": \"\", \"project\": \"\"}, \"clos\": [\"CO1: Acknowledge the continuous development of knowledge and the needs of self-upgrading.\", \"CO2: Execute an Engineering research programme.\", \"CO3: Analyse the research data.\", \"CO4: Discuss the significances, results, justifications, findings, and impacts of research.\", \"CO5: Compare and contrast the research findings and outcomes with confidence.\", \"CO6: Produce an academic writing.\"], \"presentation\": [{\"item\": \"Overall Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Presentation lack of structure, background not properly introduced, and proposed solution does not seem to be linked.\", \"Presentation organization seems adequate although linkage between background of project with proposed solution is unclear.\", \"Clear organizational pattern. Smooth presentation where background of project is explained together with acceptable solution.\", \"Professionally-structured. Very smooth presentation where background of project is explained clearly before going into very innovative solution.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Communication Skill\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Poor body language, gestures, pace/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation.\", \"Good body language and gestures but poor on pace/speed, slide arrangement, pitch/enunciation.\", \"Good body language, gestures, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation but not at correct pace/speed.\", \"Excellent body language, gestures, pace/speed, pitch, slide arrangement and/or enunciation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Objectives, Problem Statement and Scope Presentment\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Does not give relevance objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to give limited information on objectives that relates to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to state the objectives but not relate to the project background, problem statements, and project scope.\", \"Able to provide and explain the objectives with regards to project background, problem statements, and project scope.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Analysis Skill\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Does not give sufficient information that relates to the research topic or without proper citation.\", \"Able to give limited information on statement related to research topic using sentences directly from the sources.\", \"Able to state the problem but somewhat unable to relate the problem to research topic using own words.\", \"Able to relate problem statement to project using extensive information from various sources using own sentences in presentation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Impact Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Student cannot deliver the impact of the developed project with supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to sufficiently deliver impacts of the developed project with minimal supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to deliver impacts of the developed project with few supports and evidence.\", \"Student was able to excellently deliver impacts of the developed project with supports and evidence.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Result Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Student presented the result poorly.\", \"Student presented the result with hesitation and not confident.\", \"Student was able to present the result well.\", \"Student was able to present the result confidently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Q&A Justification\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Able to partially answer and defend project findings but unable to project background and scope.\", \"Able to answer and defend project findings and have difficulty to relate with project background and scope.\", \"Confidence in answering and defending project finding based on the understanding to project background and scope.\", \"Clearly and precisely answers and defends project findings based on understanding to project background and scope.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"prototype_outcome\": [{\"item\": \"Innovative Value\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Proposed project exists abundantly and are currently in use, or did not work well to solve the introduced problem.\", \"Project solution exist, not new, but still quite beneficial to the introduced problem.\", \"Project is innovative, beneficial and still need few refinements before applied to the introduced problem.\", \"Project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and can be truly applied to the introduced problem.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Implemented End Project\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 2.5, \"levels\": [\"Final product shows poor implementation work.\", \"Final product shows sufficient implementation work.\", \"Final product shows good implementation work.\", \"Final product shows excellent implementation work.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Choices of method, tools and requirement\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Student did not choose proper method, tools or select proper requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to choose sufficient method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to choose appropriate method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\", \"Student was able to excellently choose proper method, tools and select requirements based on collected data.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Functionalities\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Apps/research have been implemented but with many errors.\", \"Apps/research have been implemented but several functions are lacking.\", \"Apps/research have been implemented and functioning. Still need fine tuning before ready to be used.\", \"Apps/research have been conducted completely and fully functioning. No improvements on function needed. Higher marks if launched on platforms.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Limitation & Future Work\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Limitation & future works are poorly identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation & future works are sufficiently identified and pointed out.\", \"Limitation and possible future works in developed project are identified.\", \"Limitation and significant future works in developed project are excellently acknowledged and identified.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"End Product Demo Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 1.5, \"levels\": [\"Final outcome of FYP2 cannot be clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has a slight vagueness when delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been delivered/presented well to audience on how it works.\", \"Final outcome of FYP2 has been clearly delivered/presented to audience on how it works.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"brochure\": [{\"item\": \"Organization & Structure\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Very disorganized, confusing flow of information.\", \"Organization is weak, difficult to follow in places.\", \"Mostly organized, but some sections could be better structured.\", \"Information is logically organized, flows smoothly.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Professionalism\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not achieve professional and shows no effort in drafting; poor use of visuals; unappealing.\", \"Brochure moderately achieve professional standards and shows few efforts in drafting; limited use of visuals; basic design.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards well and shows efforts in drafting; good use of visuals, though lacking creativity or consistency.\", \"Brochure achieve professional standards and excellently drafted; excellent use of colours and visuals that enhance readability.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Methodology Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure contains very minimal or no method/process/workflow explanation.\", \"Brochure covers method/process/workflow superficially; limited explanation.\", \"Brochure covers most method/process/workflow but lacks depth in one area.\", \"Brochure clearly explains method/process/workflow at an appropriate level for the audience.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Tech Stack Choice\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not indicate tech stack/accurate tech stack.\", \"Brochure indicates tech stack but inaccurate or in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack in a sufficient way.\", \"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack, with clear explanation of each tool\'s usage.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Results/Findings Highlight\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Brochure did not highlight results/findings.\", \"Brochure included results/findings in a minimal way.\", \"Brochure included results/findings, sometimes unclear, with room for improvement or missing parts.\", \"Brochure highlighted results/findings clearly, concisely, and shows understanding of the outcome\'s significance.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"sv_evaluation\": [{\"item\": \"Progress 1 Skills in Sourcing Technical Solution/Implementation\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 5, \"levels\": [\"No efforts are demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\", \"Somewhat sufficient amount of efforts is demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, etc, but still lacking self-exploration.\", \"Sufficient amount of efforts demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\", \"Excellent amount of efforts is demonstrated in sourcing for materials, research, reading and learning, or exploration of tools for project implementation, etc.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 2 Skills in Evaluating Obtained Results\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 3, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to determine systematic evaluation method to obtain result.\", \"Student was able to somewhat determine evaluation method, with guidance and suggestion.\", \"Student was able to determine appropriate evaluation method, but lacking systematic procedure or lacking in some area.\", \"Student was able to choose excellent and systematic evaluation method to obtain results.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Identifying Project Significance, Findings, Impacts and Justification\", \"co\": \"CO4\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Student cannot discuss, justify and identify significance of the project outcome, impact, and need maximum guidance.\", \"Student was able to adequately discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome with guidance.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome well with minimal supervision.\", \"Student was able to discuss, justify and identify significance and impact of the project outcome excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 3 Skills in Analysing Results Obtained\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Student struggle to interpret results obtained and can barely discuss it with SV.\", \"Student was able to explain obtained result to SV with limited discussion.\", \"Student was able to adequately explain the obtained result to SV, but more are needed.\", \"Student was able to thoroughly and logically explain the obtained result to SV and directly related to the review of literature.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Progress 4 Final Thesis Preparation\", \"co\": \"CO6\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Final thesis submission was last minute for supervisor revision with major mistakes (formatting, organization, major correction).\", \"Final thesis submission was adequately proper for supervisor to revise with several mistakes in preparation.\", \"Final thesis submission was proper for supervisor to revise with good preparation.\", \"Final thesis submission was at proper time for supervisor revision with very good preparation (format, organization, very little correction).\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Overall Initiative & Independence\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 2, \"levels\": [\"Passive; waits for supervisor to dictate every action.\", \"Limited initiative; depends heavily on supervisor for next steps.\", \"Demonstrates initiative with occasional reliance on supervisor’s direction.\", \"Highly self-motivated; takes initiative in exploring solutions; shows ownership of project.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}, {\"item\": \"Approach to Planning\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Little to no effort. Poor attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\", \"Adequate effort. Several lacking in attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\", \"Less organised, good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation, but sometimes require reminders.\", \"Highly organised and on track. Very good attitude towards punctuality, submission and preparation.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\"}], \"report\": [{\"item\": \"Thesis Organization\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Thesis organization is not arranged logically with major errors.\", \"Thesis organization is somewhat arranged logically with weak links and several errors.\", \"Thesis organization is arranged logically and clearly linked with minimal error.\", \"Thesis organization is logical with strong link between units.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Formatting\", \"co\": \"CO1\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Margins, spacing, page numbering, typeface, Title page, Table of Contents, references and headings failed to comply with format.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, and page numbering comply with format. There are minor mistakes with headings, references, Title page, and/or Table of Contents.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, page numbering, references, and headings followed the required format. There are minor mistakes with Table of Contents.\", \"Margins, typeface, spacing, page numbering, headings, references and Table of Contents followed the required format.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Workflow Details\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project poorly.\", \"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project sufficiently.\", \"Thesis presented well the whole process of executing the project.\", \"Thesis presented the whole process of executing the project excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Gantt Chart\", \"co\": \"CO2\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Project activities and milestones are not described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are partially described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are generally described.\", \"Project activities and milestones are clearly described.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Abstract\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"The abstract does not tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are adequately clear and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are clear and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\", \"The abstract are clear, concise and to the point. The readers are able to tell what the content, extent, and conclusions of the work done.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Literature\", \"co\": \"CO3\", \"weight\": 1, \"levels\": [\"Literature consisted of a string of summaries of the various studies with no attempt to integrate similar studies.\", \"Some attempt is made to integrate similar studies and to compare and contrast findings.\", \"Similar studies are integrated and findings are somewhat compared and contrasted.\", \"The literature review is comprehensive and connected to the current study.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Results Delivery\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Results of research/implementation is written poorly.\", \"Results of research/implementation is written sufficiently.\", \"Results of research/implementation is written well.\", \"Results of research/implementation is written excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}, {\"item\": \"Analysis and Discussion\", \"co\": \"CO5\", \"weight\": 0.5, \"levels\": [\"Analysis and discussion is written poorly.\", \"Analysis and discussion is written sufficiently.\", \"Analysis and discussion is written well.\", \"Analysis and discussion is written excellently.\"], \"s\": 0, \"comments\": \"\", \"m\": 0}], \"section_meta\": {\"presentation\": {\"label\": \"Part II Presentation\", \"total_weight\": 5, \"mark_total\": 10, \"evaluators\": [\"s\", \"m\"]}, \"prototype_outcome\": {\"label\": \"Prototype Outcome\", \"total_weight\": 10, \"mark_total\": 20, \"evaluators\": [\"s\", \"m\"]}, \"brochure\": {\"label\": \"Brochure\", \"total_weight\": 2.5, \"mark_total\": 5, \"evaluators\": [\"s\", \"m\"]}, \"sv_evaluation\": {\"label\": \"SV Evaluation\", \"total_weight\": 15, \"mark_total\": 15, \"evaluators\": [\"s\"]}, \"report\": {\"label\": \"Report\", \"total_weight\": 5, \"mark_total\": 10, \"evaluators\": [\"s\", \"m\"]}}, \"totals\": {\"presentation_S\": \"0.00\", \"presentation_M\": \"0.00\", \"prototype_outcome_S\": \"0.00\", \"prototype_outcome_M\": \"0.00\", \"brochure_S\": \"0.00\", \"brochure_M\": \"0.00\", \"sv_evaluation_S\": \"0.00\", \"report_S\": \"0.00\", \"report_M\": \"0.00\", \"grand_total\": \"0.00\"}, \"section_order\": [\"presentation\", \"prototype_outcome\", \"brochure\", \"sv_evaluation\", \"report\"], \"id\": \"tpl_fyp2_marking_v7\"}','coordinator_admin','2026-05-06 01:58:13','2026-10-02 06:27:09',1,1,1);
