d project is not new but beneficial and less applied to the introduced problem.\",\"Proposed project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and applicable to the introduced problem.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Tech Stack\\/Tools Application\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are not justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are adequately justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are justified\\/suitable.\",\"Tech stack\\/tools chosen are excellently justified\\/suitable.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Preliminary Implementation\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":3,\"levels\":[\"No preliminary UI\\/experiments have been conducted.\",\"Poor preliminary UI\\/experiments have been designed\\/conducted.\",\"Sufficient preliminary UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted.\",\"UI\\/experiments have been partially designed\\/conducted. Some preliminary results have been obtained\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Time Management\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' poor management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' sufficient management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' good management of time in conducting it.\",\"End product in FYP1 shows students\' excellent management of time in conducting it.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"End Product Demo\\/Delivery\",\"co\":\"CO6\",\"weight\":2.5,\"levels\":[\"No final outcome of FYP1 that has a solid existence to be delivered\\/presented, only theory\\/process idea.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a slight existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has little existence to be delivered\\/presented.\",\"Final outcome of FYP1 has a solid existence\\/prototype to be delivered\\/presented.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"}],\"justification\":\"\",\"general_commen