CO4\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Student cannot deliver the impact of the developed project with supports and evidence.\",\"Student was able to sufficiently deliver impacts of the developed project with minimal supports and evidence.\",\"Student was able to deliver impacts of the developed project with few supports and evidence.\",\"Student was able to excellently deliver impacts of the developed project with supports and evidence.\"],\"s\":70,\"m\":70,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Result Delivery\",\"co\":\"CO4\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Student presented the result poorly.\",\"Student presented the result with hesitation and not confident.\",\"Student was able to present the result well.\",\"Student was able to present the result confidently.\"],\"s\":70,\"m\":70,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Q&A Justification\",\"co\":\"CO5\",\"weight\":1,\"levels\":[\"Able to partially answer and defend project findings but unable to project background and scope.\",\"Able to answer and defend project findings and have difficulty to relate with project background and scope.\",\"Confidence in answering and defending project finding based on the understanding to project background and scope.\",\"Clearly and precisely answers and defends project findings based on understanding to project background and scope.\"],\"s\":70,\"m\":71,\"comments\":\"\"}],\"prototype_outcome\":[{\"item\":\"Innovative Value\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":1.5,\"levels\":[\"Proposed project exists abundantly and are currently in use, or did not work well to solve the introduced problem.\",\"Project solution exist, not new, but still quite beneficial to the introduced problem.\",\"Project is innovative, beneficial and still need few refinements before applied to the introduced problem.\",\"Project is very innovative, significantly beneficial and can be truly applied to the introduced problem.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Implemented End Project\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":2.5,\"level