ered\\/presented to audience on how it works.\",\"Final outcome of FYP2 has been delivered\\/presented well to audience on how it works.\",\"Final outcome of FYP2 has been clearly delivered\\/presented to audience on how it works.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"}],\"brochure\":[{\"item\":\"Organization & Structure\",\"co\":\"CO1\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Very disorganized, confusing flow of information.\",\"Organization is weak, difficult to follow in places.\",\"Mostly organized, but some sections could be better structured.\",\"Information is logically organized, flows smoothly.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Professionalism\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Brochure did not achieve professional and shows no effort in drafting; poor use of visuals; unappealing.\",\"Brochure moderately achieve professional standards and shows few efforts in drafting; limited use of visuals; basic design.\",\"Brochure achieve professional standards well and shows efforts in drafting; good use of visuals, though lacking creativity or consistency.\",\"Brochure achieve professional standards and excellently drafted; excellent use of colours and visuals that enhance readability.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Methodology Highlight\",\"co\":\"CO2\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Brochure contains very minimal or no method\\/process\\/workflow explanation.\",\"Brochure covers method\\/process\\/workflow superficially; limited explanation.\",\"Brochure covers most method\\/process\\/workflow but lacks depth in one area.\",\"Brochure clearly explains method\\/process\\/workflow at an appropriate level for the audience.\"],\"s\":0,\"m\":0,\"comments\":\"\"},{\"item\":\"Tech Stack Choice\",\"co\":\"CO3\",\"weight\":0.5,\"levels\":[\"Brochure did not indicate tech stack\\/accurate tech stack.\",\"Brochure indicates tech stack but inaccurate or in a minimal way.\",\"Brochure indicates accurate tech stack in a sufficient way.\",\"Brochure